<deviceset name="WE-MXGA_4030" urn="urn:adsk.eagle:component:53544501/1">
<description>WE-MXGA SMT Power Inductor

Characteristics
Innovative iron alloy material
Ultra low RDC and AC losses
High efficiency and current capability
Optimized for high switching frequencies beyond 1 MHz
Magnetically shielded construction
Compact design
Operating temperature: -40 ºC up to 125 ºC

Applications
Body electronics &amp; lighting
Infotainment systems
DC/DC-converter 48 V / 12 V
POL-converter
DC/DC converter for field programmable gate array
BMS (battery management system)

Details see: www.we-online.com/components/products/WE-MXGA

Created by Ella 2026-09-22
2026 (C) Würth Elektronik</description>
